Naga hatchlings will in 3.4.1 _never_ grow up, because their
hatchling-shape maximum level is lower than the adult nagas' minimum
levels. And nagas/naga hatchlings never eat and don't use potions,
either.

Many other monsters can reach higher "ranks" by killing other
monsters. The only case where food plays a role in getting pets to
level up is wraith corpses. Item-using pets (humans, humanoids,
demons, smarter undead ...) can also gain levels by quaffing a certain
potion. Any monster can reach the absolute maximum of level 49 by
potions, the other methods are much more limited.

